        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="WorkLog"></a>Work Log</h3>

<p>Completed cross-layer validation of order information by comparing Order ID and Order Status across the Web UI, REST API, and SQL Database. Verified that all values remained consistent throughout the transaction lifecycle.</p>

<h3><a name="Result"></a>Result</h3>

<p>PASS</p>

<h3><a name="Evidence"></a>Evidence</h3>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11228" alt="image-20260617-105136.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/11229" alt="image-20260617-105240.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

