    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Pre-conditions</b><br/>
User is on the payment page with a product/order ready for checkout.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Enter an invalid card number format.</li>
	<li>Enter an expired card date.</li>
	<li>Enter an invalid CVV.</li>
	<li>Click “Pay Now”.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Results</b> <br/>
System validates card details and displays appropriate error messages for invalid format, expired card, or incorrect CVV. Payment is not processed.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result</b> <br/>
System approved invalid card details</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

