    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name=""></a></h3>



<p>The category filter menu on the Furniture page overlaps the product content area when the user scrolls down the page. Category labels remain visible over the "All Products" heading and product listing section, resulting in a cluttered and misaligned user interface.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10810" alt="image-20260601-071229.png" width="667" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
