    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Test Objective:<br/>
403 Forbidden Assertion of account lockout functionality after 5 failed login attempts.</p>

<p>Expected Result:<br/>
API should return status code 403 Forbidden.</p>

<p>Actual Result:<br/>
API returned status code 401 Unauthorized instead of 403.</p>

<p>Assertion Used:<br/>
pm.response.to.have.status(403);</p>

<p>Outcome:<br/>
FAILED</p>

<p>Observation:<br/>
The current API implementation does not appear to support account lockout functionality.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10744" alt="image-20260520-062940.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

