        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Logged in · Product in cart with quantity field visible</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Add a product to cart</li>
	<li>Change quantity to 0 and attempt to update</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>System does not allow 0 quanitity</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>System does not allow zero or negative quantities.</p>
