    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Logged in · Product in cart · At checkout step</p>

<p>Steps to Reproduce </p>

<ol>
	<li>Add a product to cart and proceed to checkout</li>
	<li>Double-click the "Place Order" or "Pay" button rapidly</li>
	<li>Observe whether the button is disabled after first click</li>
	<li>Navigate to order history — count matching orders for this session</li>
	<li>Run SQL: SELECT COUNT<img class="emoticon" src="/images/icons/emoticons/star_yellow.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/> FROM Orders WHERE CustomerId = 
{id}
<p> AND CreatedAt &gt;= DATEADD(MINUTE,-1,GETUTCDATE())</p></li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>Exactly 1 order created · Button disabled after first click · DB count = 1 for recent orders · No duplicate payment record</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>No Idempotency, clicking multiple times creates duplicates. </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

