    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Verify inventory is restored when an unpaid order is cancelled.</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User logged in.</li>
	<li>Product available.</li>
	<li>Order not paid.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Login.</li>
	<li>Add product to cart.</li>
	<li>Proceed to checkout.</li>
	<li>Cancel order before payment.</li>
	<li>Return to product listing.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Order cancelled successfully.</li>
	<li>Product inventory restored.</li>
	<li>Product remains available for purchase.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b></p>

<p>Cannot cancel order before payment, “View” button does not work.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

