    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>A paid/confirmed order exists — use one of the 5 seeded orders or complete a checkout</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to order history (e.g. /orders or /dashboard)</li>
	<li>Open a paid/confirmed order</li>
	<li>Attempt to click Edit or change quantity</li>
	<li>Also try: PUT /api/Orders/
{id} with updated quantity via Postman<br/>
<br/>
<b>Expected result</b><br/>
<br/>
UI: Edit controls are disabled or hidden · API: PUT /api/Orders/{id}
<p> returns 403 Forbidden for a paid order</p></li>
</ol>


<p><b>Test data</b></p>

<p>One of the 5 seeded orders with status CONFIRMED/PAID · Or place + pay for a new order first</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

