    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Logged in, Product in cart and added a coupon code that does not exist</p>

<p><b>Steps to reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Add a product to cart · Note current total</li>
	<li>Enter coupon code: COUPON26 (invalid coupon code)</li>
	<li>Click Apply</li>
	<li>Observe the UI response</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>Error message displayed: "Invalid promo code" or similar · Order total unchanged · No discount applied</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>Error message displayed: "Invalid promo code" - Order total unchanged · No discount applied</p>

<p><b>DEFECT –</b> wrong image for large mirror</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

