    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            

<p><b>Summary</b><br/>
Verified that order totals are calculated correctly based on item quantity, item price, and applicable tax, added 2 items.</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User logged in.</li>
	<li>Product available.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Login.</li>
	<li>Add product to cart.</li>
	<li>Open cart.</li>
	<li>Note displayed item price.</li>
	<li>Note displayed quantity.</li>
	<li>Calculate expected total manually.</li>
	<li>Compare calculated total with displayed total.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Displayed total equals:</li>
	<li>(Item Price × Quantity) + Tax</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Correct Order totals calculated, <b>Defect</b> – incorrect image shown for Memory Foam Mattress</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

