    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Summary</b><br/>
Verify that removing a product from the cart updates the order total correctly.</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User is logged in.</li>
	<li>Product exists in catalog.</li>
	<li>Product has been added to cart.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Login to the application.</li>
	<li>Navigate to Products.</li>
	<li>Add a product to the cart.</li>
	<li>Open Cart.</li>
	<li>Record current order total.</li>
	<li>Remove the product from the cart.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Product is removed from cart.</li>
	<li>Order total decreases accordingly.</li>
	<li>Cart reflects updated item count.</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Product is removed from cart.</li>
	<li>Order total decreases accordingly.</li>
	<li>Cart reflects updated item count.</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

