    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Logged in · On product listing page</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://localhost:3000</a></li>
	<li>Click "Add to cart" on any product</li>
	<li>Check cart badge/icon in the header</li>
	<li>Open cart and verify product appears with correct name and price</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>Cart count increases to 1 · Product shown in cart with correct name, quantity (1) and unit price</p>

<p><b>Test data</b></p>

<p>Any of the 12 seeded products · Default quantity = 1</p>
