    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title</b><br/>
Cancel Order and Restore Inventory via API</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b><br/>
Existing order has reserved inventory. Authentication token available.</p>

<p><b>Test steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Create order containing inventory item.</li>
	<li>Capture inventory quantity before cancellation.</li>
	<li>Send order cancellation request.</li>
	<li>Retrieve product inventory.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected results</b><br/>
Order status changes to Cancelled. Inventory quantity is restored by the reserved amount. API returns successful cancellation response.</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b> <br/>
There is no endpoint to update order status to Cancelled.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

