    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title</b><br/>
Update ReturnStatus </p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b><br/>
Unpaid order exists. API authentication token available</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b><br/>
1. Create unpaid order.<br/>
2. Send PUT/PATCH request to update status.<br/>
3. Send PUT/PATCH request to update Approved amount.<br/>
4. Send PUT/PATCH request to update resolution notes<br/>
5. Retrieve updated order.</p>

<p><b>Expected results</b><br/>
Return status is updated successfully. Returned status, approved amount and resolution notes is updated successfully. Updated values are returned by the API.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

