    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title</b><br/>
Verify Order Total Calculation (Items × Price) + Tax</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b> <br/>
1. User is authenticated.<br/>
2. Product catalogue contains products with defined prices.<br/>
3. Tax rate is configured in the system.<br/>
4. Order creation endpoint is available in Postman.</p>

<p><b>Test steps</b><br/>
1. Send a POST request to create an order.<br/>
2. Add Luxe Down Pillows (Set of 2) with quantity = 6 and price = 5999.00 each.<br/>
3.  Submit the order request.<br/>
4. Retrieve the order details using the Order ID returned from the response.<br/>
5. Manually calculate the expected subtotal: (6 × 5999.00) = R35994.00<br/>
6. Calculate the expected tax according to the configured tax rate 15% = R5399.10<br/>
7. Calculate the expected total: R35994.00 + R5399.10 = <ins><b>R41393.10.</b></ins><br/>
8. Compare the manually calculated total with the order total returned by the API.</p>

<p><b>Expected results</b><br/>
Order is created successfully with a 200/201 response status.<br/>
The subtotal is calculated correctly based on item quantities and prices.<br/>
The correct tax amount is applied.<br/>
The order total equals <b>(Items × Price) + Tax</b>.<br/>
The total returned by the API matches the manually calculated expected total.</p>

<p><b>Actual results</b><br/>
The total returned by the API did not matche the manually calculated expected total.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
<table class="tableBorder" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="100%" colspan="2" valign="top">
                            <b><a id="parent_issue_summary" href="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/browse/LCP-64">Payment API tests</a></b>
                <span style="font-size: 9px">(<a id="parent_issue_key" href="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/browse/LCP-64">LCP-64</a>)</span>
                <h3 class="formtitle"><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/images/icons/link_out_bot.gif" width="16" height="16" />
                        [LCP-78]&nbsp;<a href="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/browse/LCP-78">Graceful Handling of Payment Decline</a>
            <span class="subText">
               Created: 20/May/26                   &nbsp;Updated: 18/Jun/26

                                                    &nbsp;Resolved: 18/Jun/26
                            </span>
