    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Global Error Handling Tests</b></p>

<p>4 test cases executed </p>

<p><b>T-API-ERR-001</b>: Invalid request body returns 400 </p>

<p>Method: POST /api/Orders (with invalid JSON fields)</p>

<p>Expected: 400 Bad Request, error message in response </p>

<p>Result: PASS </p>



<p><b>T-API-ERR-002:</b> Unauthenticated request returns 401 </p>

<p>Method: GET /api/Orders (no Authorization header) </p>

<p>Expected: 401 Unauthorized, no sensitive data leaked </p>

<p>Result: PASS </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

