    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Returns API Tests</b></p>

<p>4 test cases executed </p>

<p><b>T-API-RET-001</b>: Initiate valid return request </p>

<p>Method: POST /api/Returns </p>

<p>Expected: 201 Created, response contains id and status </p>

<p>Result: PASS </p>



<p><b>T-API-RET-002</b>: Get return status for existing return </p>

<p>Method: GET /api/Returns/<tt>returnId</tt> </p>

<p>Expected: 200 OK, id matches, status is valid value </p>

<p>Result: PASS</p>



<p><b>T-API-RET-003</b>: Refund processed for approved return </p>

<p>Method: GET /api/Returns </p>

<p>Expected: 200 OK, returns array, approved returns have refund info </p>

<p>Result: PASS</p>



<p><b>T-API-RET-004</b>: Return outside 30-day window rejected </p>

<p>Method: POST /api/Returns </p>

<p>Expected: 400/422, error message exists, no 500 </p>

<p>Result: PASS</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

