    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h2><a name="TAPIDEL001%3ARetrieveDeliverybyOrderID"></a>T-API-DEL-001: Retrieve Delivery by Order ID</h2>

<p><b>Objective:</b> Confirm that a delivery record can be retrieved using an order ID.<br/>
<b>Endpoint:</b> {{GET /api/Deliveries/</p>
{orderId}}}<br/>
<b>Test Data:</b> <tt>LWS-93113</tt><br/>
<b>Expected Result:</b> API returns <tt>200 OK</tt> and displays the delivery record.<br/>
<b>Actual Result:</b> Delivery record was successfully retrieved using order ID LWS-93113.<br/>
<b>Status:</b> PASS<br/>
<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10606" alt="image-20260525-141614.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
h2. T-API-DEL-002: Verify POD Recorded<br/>
<br/>
<b>Objective:</b> Confirm that proof of delivery is recorded for a completed delivery.<br/>
<b>Endpoint:</b> {{GET /api/Deliveries/{orderId}
<p>}}<br/>
<b>Test Data:</b> <tt>LWS-93113</tt><br/>
<b>Expected Result:</b> Response contains <tt>status = Delivered</tt> and <tt>deliveredAtUtc</tt>.<br/>
<b>Actual Result:</b> Response showed Delivered status with a populated delivery timestamp for order LWS-93113.<br/>
<b>Status:</b> PASS</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10607" alt="image-20260525-141640.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h2><a name="TAPIDEL003%3AVerifyNotificationTriggered"></a>T-API-DEL-003: Verify Notification Triggered</h2>

<p><b>Objective:</b> Confirm that delivery activity was updated after delivery completion.<br/>
<b>Endpoint:</b> {{GET /api/Deliveries/</p>
{orderId}}}<br/>
<b>Test Data:</b> <tt>LWS-93113</tt><br/>
<b>Expected Result:</b> Response contains an updated <tt>updatedAtUtc</tt> timestamp.<br/>
<b>Actual Result:</b> Response showed an updated timestamp, confirming delivery activity updates for order LWS-93113.<br/>
<b>Status:</b> PASS<br/>
<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10609" alt="image-20260525-141655.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
h2. T-API-DEL-004: Verify Tracking Details<br/>
<br/>
<b>Objective:</b> Confirm that tracking details are available for the delivery.<br/>
<b>Endpoint:</b> {{GET /api/Deliveries/{orderId}
<p>}}<br/>
<b>Test Data:</b> <tt>LWS-93113</tt><br/>
<b>Expected Result:</b> Response contains <tt>trackingNumber</tt>, <tt>carrier</tt>, and <tt>currentLocation</tt>.<br/>
<b>Actual Result:</b> Response displayed tracking number, carrier, and current shipment location for order LWS-93113.<br/>
<b>Status:</b> PASS</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10608" alt="image-20260525-141716.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
<table class="tableBorder" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="100%" colspan="2" valign="top">
