    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h2><a name="TAPIDEL001%E2%80%94CreateOrderforShipment"></a>T-API-DEL-001 — Create Order for Shipment</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that a new order can be created successfully for shipment processing.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>POST /api/Orders</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>Order is created successfully and returns <tt>201 Created</tt>.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>Order was successfully created and returned a valid order ID for shipment tracking purposes.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10534" alt="image-20260525-071019.png" width="395" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h2><a name="TAPIDEL002%E2%80%94RetrieveAllOrders"></a>T-API-DEL-002 — Retrieve All Orders</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that all orders can be retrieved successfully.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>GET /api/Orders</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>API returns all available orders with status <tt>200 OK</tt>.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>All orders were successfully retrieved from the system.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10535" alt="image-20260525-071147.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<h2><a name="TAPIDEL003%E2%80%94RetrieveAllDeliveries"></a>T-API-DEL-003 — Retrieve All Deliveries</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that all delivery/shipment records can be retrieved successfully.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>GET /api/Deliveries</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>API returns all delivery records with status <tt>200 OK</tt>.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>Delivery records were successfully retrieved from the API.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10532" alt="image-20260525-071230.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<h2><a name="TAPIDEL004%E2%80%94RetrieveDeliverybyOrderID"></a>T-API-DEL-004 — Retrieve Delivery by Order ID</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that a delivery record can be retrieved using a valid order ID.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>GET /api/Deliveries/{orderId}</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>API returns the correct delivery details for the specified order ID.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>Delivery details were successfully retrieved using the supplied order ID.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10533" alt="image-20260525-071311.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h2><a name="TAPIDEL005%E2%80%94FilterDeliveriesbyShipmentStatus"></a>T-API-DEL-005 — Filter Deliveries by Shipment Status</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that delivery records can be filtered using shipment status.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>GET /api/Deliveries?status=Shipped</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>API returns delivery records matching the specified shipment status.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>Delivery records filtered by shipment status were successfully returned.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10537" alt="image-20260525-071513.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<h2><a name="TAPIDEL006%E2%80%94FilterDeliveriesbyOrderID"></a>T-API-DEL-006 — Filter Deliveries by Order ID</h2>

<h3><a name="Description"></a>Description</h3>

<p>Verify that delivery records can be filtered using an order ID query parameter.</p>

<h3><a name="Endpoint"></a>Endpoint</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>GET /api/Deliveries?orderId={orderId}</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a>Expected Result</h3>

<p>API returns delivery records matching the specified order ID.</p>

<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a>Actual Result</h3>

<p>Delivery records filtered by order ID were successfully retrieved.</p>

<h3><a name="Status"></a>Status</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>PASS</pre>
</div></div>



<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10536" alt="image-20260525-071545.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

