    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Objective:</b> Ensuring the system prevents fulfilling an order if the requested quantity exceeds the current stock.</p>

<p><b>Pre-condition:</b> Aurora Wireless Speaker has stock quantity.</p>

<p><b>Test Step:</b> Attempting to create and process a sales order or fulfilment request for units of Aurora Wireless Speaker.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result:</b> The system should display a validation error (e.g., <em>"Insufficient stock available"</em>) and completely block the transaction from completing. The stock should remain.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

