    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title</b><br/>
Verify Order Record Exists After Successful Creation</p>

<p><b>Preconditions</b><br/>
Order has been successfully created through API. Database access available</p>

<p><b>Test steps</b><br/>
1. Create an order.<br/>
2. Execute SQL query against Orders table using Order ID.<br/>
3. Review stored data.</p>

<p><b>Expected results</b><br/>
Order record exists. Customer ID, status, total amount, and timestamps are populated correctly.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

