    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Test objective</b></p>

<p>Confirm that no paid or active order exists without a matching row in the Deliveries table. Orphaned orders indicate a shipment creation failure in the order fulfilment pipeline.</p>

<p><b>SQL validation approach</b></p>

<p>LEFT JOIN Orders → Deliveries, filtering for non-Cancelled and non-Pending statuses, then asserting NULL on DeliveryId column.</p>

<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>0 rows returned — no orphaned orders.</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>0 rows returned. All active orders (ORD-001 through ORD-003) have matching Deliveries records.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

