    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Pre-conditions</b> <br/>
User is on the checkout page with an invalid or blocked card.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b> </p>

<ol>
	<li>Enter card details for a declined/invalid card.</li>
	<li>Submit payment.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Results</b><br/>
System declines the payment gracefully with a clear error message (e.g., “Payment Declined”). No system crash or sensitive error details are shown. Failed attempt is logged in the audit trail.</p>

<p>Actual Results <br/>
System accepted invalid card.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

