    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Pre-conditions</b> <br/>
User has a valid payment card and an active order.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b> </p>

<ol>
	<li>Enter a valid credit card number.</li>
	<li>Enter a valid expiry date and CVV.</li>
	<li>Submit payment.</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Results</b><br/>
Payment is successfully authorized and confirmation is displayed to the user. Transaction is recorded in the audit trail/logs.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
