    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="TestCase%3AConfirmOrderStatusTransitionsAreValid"></a><b>Test Case: Confirm Order Status Transitions Are Valid</b></h3>

<h3><a name="Preconditions%3A"></a><b>Preconditions:</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>Database <tt>LewisStoresDb</tt> is accessible</li>
	<li>Orders table contains existing records with multiple statuses</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name="TestSteps%3A"></a><b>Test Steps:</b></h3>

<ol>
	<li>Connect to the <tt>LewisStoresDb</tt> database</li>
	<li>Execute the query:</li>
</ol>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>SELECT 
    Status as [OrderStatus],
    COUNT(*) as [OrderCount],
    ROUND(100.0 * COUNT(*) / (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Orders), 2) as [Percentage]
FROM Orders
GROUP BY Status
ORDER BY [OrderCount] DESC;</pre>
</div></div>

<ol>
	<li>Review grouped order status results</li>
	<li>Validate that all statuses are correctly aggregated</li>
	<li>Confirm percentage calculation is accurate</li>
	<li>Ensure no invalid or null statuses exist</li>
</ol>


<h3><a name="ExpectedResult%3A"></a><b>Expected Result:</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>All order statuses are grouped correctly without duplication</li>
	<li>Each status reflects an accurate count of orders</li>
	<li>Percentage values correctly represent each status proportion of total orders</li>
	<li>No missing, null, or invalid status values exist in the dataset</li>
	<li>Status transitions are consistently represented in the database</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name="ActualResult%3A"></a><b>Actual Result:</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>Query executed successfully on the <tt>Orders</tt> table</li>
	<li>System returned grouped order status distribution without errors</li>
	<li>All existing order statuses were successfully aggregated and displayed</li>
	<li>No invalid, duplicate grouping anomalies, or null status values were detected</li>
	<li>Percentage calculations were generated for each status based on total order count</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name="Status%3A"></a><b>Status:</b></h3>

<p>✔ Pass</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10463" alt="image-20260521-082037.png" width="395" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

