    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h2><a name="TestCase%3AVerifyOrderTotalCalculation"></a><b>Test Case: Verify Order Total Calculation</b></h2>

<h3><a name="Objective"></a><b>Objective</b></h3>

<p>Check if the order total in the database matches the items in the order.</p>

<h3><a name="Steps"></a><b>Steps</b></h3>

<ol>
	<li>Run the SQL query on the <tt>Orders</tt> table.</li>
	<li>Get <tt>OrderId</tt>, <tt>StoredTotal</tt>, and <tt>ItemCount</tt>.</li>
	<li>Check the result.</li>
</ol>


<h3><a name="ExpectedResult"></a><b>Expected Result</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>All orders should show <b>“Match”</b></li>
	<li>Stored total should be correct for all orders</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name="ActualResult"></a><b>Actual Result</b></h3>

<ul>
	<li>All orders returned <b>Match</b></li>
	<li>No mismatches found</li>
</ul>


<h3><a name="Conclusion"></a><b>Conclusion</b></h3>

<p>Order totals are correctly stored in the database</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10777" alt="image-20260526-093614.png" width="667" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
