    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Title</b><br/>
Successfully Create Order with Valid Product and Quantity</p>

<p>Preconditions<br/>
User is authenticated. Product exists with available stock.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b><br/>
1. Create a new order.<br/>
2. Add a valid product with quantity within available stock.<br/>
3. Submit the order.</p>

<p><b>Expected results</b> <br/>
Order is created successfully. Product is added to the order. Order status is created.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

