    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Test Objective:<br/>
200 OK Assertion of Valid User.</p>

<p>Request:<br/>
POST /api/auth/login</p>

<p>Expected Result:<br/>
Status code 200 OK returned.<br/>
JWT token generated successfully.</p>

<p>Actual Result:<br/>
API returned status code 200.<br/>
Token successfully generated.</p>

<p>Assertion Used:<br/>
pm.response.to.have.status(200);</p>

<p>Test Status:<br/>
PASS</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10356" alt="image-20260520-062415.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Test Objective:<br/>
401 Unauthorized Assertion of Invalid Credentials.</p>

<p>Request:<br/>
POST /api/auth/login</p>

<p>Expected Result:<br/>
Status code 401 Unauthorized returned.</p>

<p>Actual Result:<br/>
API returned status code 401 Unauthorized.</p>

<p>Assertion Used:<br/>
pm.response.to.have.status(401);</p>

<p>Test Status:<br/>
PASS</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10358" alt="image-20260520-062754.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>Test Objective:<br/>
403 Forbidden Assertion of account lockout functionality after 5 failed login attempts.</p>

<p>Expected Result:<br/>
API should return status code 403 Forbidden.</p>

<p>Actual Result:<br/>
API returned status code 401 Unauthorized instead of 403.</p>

<p>Assertion Used:<br/>
pm.response.to.have.status(403);</p>

<p>Outcome:<br/>
FAILED</p>

<p>Observation:<br/>
The current API implementation does not appear to support account lockout functionality.</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10357" alt="image-20260520-062940.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
