    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h1><a name="1.POST%2Fauth%2Flogin%28Validlogin%29"></a>1. POST /auth/login (Valid login)</h1>

<h3><a name="Goal%3A"></a>Goal:</h3>

<p>Confirm a correct user can log in successfully.</p>

<h3><a name="StepsinPostman%3A"></a>Steps in Postman:</h3>

<ol>
	<li>Open <b>Postman</b></li>
	<li>Click <b>New → HTTP Request</b></li>
	<li>Set method to <b>POST</b></li>
	<li>Enter URL:
<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>http://localhost:5000/auth/login</pre>
</div></div></li>
	<li>Go to <b>Body → raw → JSON</b></li>
	<li>Enter valid credentials:
<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>{
  "email": "test.customer@lewisstores.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}</pre>
</div></div></li>
	<li>Click <b>Send</b></li>
</ol>


<h3><a name="Expectedresult%3A"></a>Expected result:</h3>

<ul>
	<li>Status: <tt>200 OK</tt></li>
	<li>Response contains:
	<ul>
		<li>JWT token OR session token</li>
		<li>user info</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10320" alt="image-20260519-103625.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h1><a name="2.POST%2Fauth%2Flogin%28Invalidlogin%29"></a>2. POST /auth/login (Invalid login)</h1>

<h3><a name="Goal%3A"></a>Goal:</h3>

<p>Check system rejects wrong credentials.</p>

<h3><a name="Steps%3A"></a>Steps:</h3>

<p>Same as above but change body:</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>{
  "email": "test.customer@lewisstores.local",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Expectedresult%3A"></a>Expected result:</h3>

<ul>
	<li>Status: <tt>401 Unauthorized</tt> (or <tt>400 Bad Request</tt>)</li>
	<li>Message like:
	<ul>
		<li>“Invalid credentials”</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10322" alt="image-20260519-103815.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h1><a name="3.GET%2Fauth%2Fme%28Tokenvalidationtest%29%E2%9C%85"></a>3. GET /auth/me (Token validation test) ✅</h1>

<h3><a name="Goal%3A"></a>Goal:</h3>

<p>Check if the token allows access to protected routes.</p>

<h3><a name="Request%3A"></a>Request:</h3>

<ul>
	<li>Method: <tt>GET</tt></li>
	<li>URL:</li>
</ul>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Headers%3A"></a>Headers:</h3>

<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<th class='confluenceTh'>Key</th>
<th class='confluenceTh'>Value</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Authorization</td>
<td class='confluenceTd'>Bearer YOUR_TOKEN</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>


<p>Example:</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Expectedresult%3A"></a>Expected result:</h3>

<ul>
	<li><tt>200 OK</tt></li>
	<li>Returns user info</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10323" alt="image-20260519-104820.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<h2><a name="4.POST%2Fauth%2Flogin%28Missingfieldsvalidation%29"></a>4. POST /auth/login (Missing fields validation)</h2>

<h3><a name="Goal%3A"></a>Goal:</h3>

<p>Check validation when required fields are missing.</p>

<h3><a name="Request%3A"></a>Request:</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Body%28missingpassword%29%3A"></a>Body (missing password):</h3>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}</pre>
</div></div>

<h3><a name="Expectedresult%3A"></a>Expected result:</h3>

<ul>
	<li><tt>400 Bad Request</tt></li>
	<li>Message like:
	<ul>
		<li>“Password is required”</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="https://redacademy-team-quallityengineer.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10321" alt="image-20260519-105457.png" width="380" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

<hr class='fullcontent'><br /><br style='page-break-before:always;'/><br />
