    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b><br/>
User has multiple orders with different dates, statuses, and prices</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b><br/>
1. Login to dashboard <br/>
2. Open Order History filters <br/>
3. Apply date range filter <br/>
4. Apply status filter (e.g., Completed) <br/>
5. Apply price range filter6. Verify filtered results</p>

<p><b>Expected Results</b><br/>
Orders displayed match the selected date range, status, and price criteria without incorrect records appearing</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

