User account exists with completed orders</p>

<p><b>Test steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Login to user account<br/>
2. Navigate to Dashboard → Order History<br/>
3. Verify orders loads</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected results</b></p>

<p>Order history loads successfully with correct pagination controls and accurate order records displayed per page</p>

