    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Logged in · 1 product in cart · Payment NOT yet submitted</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Add 1 unit of a product to cart</li>
	<li>Note current total (price × 1)</li>
	<li>Change quantity from 1 to 2 using the quantity control</li>
	<li>Confirm/update the cart</li>
	<li>Verify the new total equals price × 2 (+ tax)</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>Quantity updates · Total recalculates to (price × quantity amount) + tax · Cart count badge updates</p>

<p><b>Actual result</b></p>

<p>Luca Modular Sofa (price × 18) + tax · Cart count badge updates</p>

<p>Aurora Wireless Speaker (price × 6) + tax </p>

<p>· Cart count badge updates</p>

<p>Calculates the collect total = R579 572</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

