    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>Preconditions</b></p>

<p>Lewis Stores running · User logged in as test.customer@lewisstores.local</p>

<p><b>Steps to Reproduce</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://localhost:3000</a></li>
	<li>Observe the product listing page</li>
	<li>Verify products are displayed with name, price, category, and image</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected result</b></p>

<p>12 unique products visible · Each shows name, price and category · UI count matches API response count</p>

<p><b>Actual Result</b> </p>

<p>14 products loaded, only 6 items have photos and some items are not depicting the correct image as mentioned in Title and Description </p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

