    <table cellpadding="2" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" align="center">
    <tr>
        <td bgcolor="#bbbbbb" width="1%" nowrap align="center">
            &nbsp;<font color="#ffffff"><b>Description</b></font>&nbsp;
        </td>
        <td>&nbsp;</td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>Users can create, modify, and cancel orders with full retail business logic validation. Tests cover the complete order lifecycle on the Lewis Stores platform (localhost:3000), verified across UI, API, and database layers.</p>

<p><b>Acceptance criteria</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>Add products to order with quantity validation</li>
	<li>Calculate order total (items × price + tax)</li>
	<li>Apply valid coupon codes for discounts</li>
	<li>Modify order pre-payment (change quantity, address)</li>
	<li>Cannot modify order post-payment</li>
	<li>Cancel order returns inventory to stock</li>
	<li>Idempotency — no duplicate orders</li>
</ul>

            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

