    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="AUTH004%3ALogoutinvalidatessession"></a>AUTH-004: Logout invalidates session</h3>

<p><b>Objective</b><br/>
Verify that logging out properly terminates the active user session.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Log in with valid credentials</li>
	<li>Verify successful login</li>
	<li>Click the Logout button</li>
	<li>Attempt to access the Profile/Login page again</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User session is terminated</li>
	<li>User is redirected to authentication screen</li>
	<li>Sign In button becomes visible</li>
	<li>Protected pages are no longer accessible without login</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b><br/>
User was successfully logged out and Sign In option was displayed.</p>

<p><b>Status</b><br/>
PASS</p>

