    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="AUTH003%3ASessionpersistsacrosspagenavigation"></a>AUTH-003: Session persists across page navigation</h3>

<p><b>Objective</b><br/>
Verify that the authenticated session remains active during page navigation and browser refresh.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Log in with valid credentials</li>
	<li>Navigate to the Products page</li>
	<li>Refresh the browser</li>
	<li>Navigate back to the Profile page</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User remains authenticated after navigation</li>
	<li>Session is maintained after browser refresh</li>
	<li>User can still access protected pages without re-logging in</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b><br/>
Session remained active across navigation and refresh actions.</p>

<p><b>Status</b><br/>
PASS</p>

<p><div class="embeddedObject"><object classid="clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B" codebase="https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab" data="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10709?stream=true" height="380" type="video/mp4" width="380" ><param name="data" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10709?stream=true"/><param name="src" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10709?stream=true"/><param name="type" value="video/mp4"/><embed height="380" pluginspage="https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/" src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10709?stream=true" type="video/mp4" width="380" /></object></div></p>
