    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <h3><a name="AUTH001%3AValidloginsucceedsandsessioniscreated"></a>AUTH-001: Valid login succeeds and session is created</h3>

<p><b>Objective</b><br/>
Verify that a registered user can successfully log into the system using valid credentials.</p>

<p><b>Test Steps</b></p>

<ol>
	<li>Navigate to the Profile page</li>
	<li>Click the Login button</li>
	<li>Enter a valid email address</li>
	<li>Enter a valid password</li>
	<li>Click the Sign In button</li>
</ol>


<p><b>Expected Result</b></p>

<ul>
	<li>User is successfully authenticated</li>
	<li>User is redirected to the <tt>/profile</tt> page</li>
	<li>Active session is created</li>
	<li>No authentication errors are displayed</li>
</ul>


<p><b>Actual Result</b><br/>
User logged in successfully and was redirected to the Profile page.</p>

<p><b>Status</b><br/>
PASS</p>

<p><div class="embeddedObject"><object classid="clsid:02BF25D5-8C17-4B23-BC80-D3488ABDDC6B" codebase="https://www.apple.com/qtactivex/qtplugin.cab" data="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10643?stream=true" height="380" type="video/mp4" width="380" ><param name="data" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10643?stream=true"/><param name="src" value="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10643?stream=true"/><param name="type" value="video/mp4"/><embed height="380" pluginspage="https://www.apple.com/quicktime/download/" src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10643?stream=true" type="video/mp4" width="380" /></object></div></p>
            <br/>
